  "descriptions": {
    "preferred": "With finely cut lacy leaves, 'Green Hornet' has the distinction of being the only green dissectum with outstanding red fall color. The spring leaves are green, tinged orange, changing to a fresh green for the summer, before turning a beautiful bright red in the fall. The green summer foliage contrasts attractively with the green flushed-orange new growth appearing throughout the summer. HORNET"
  },
